sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as New clinic
  participant E as Data engineer
  participant P as Pipeline
  participant U as Ops UI

  C->>P: first files arrive (no profile exists)
  P->>P: _default profile applies<br/>schema-on-read
  P->>U: rows load, tagged clinic_profile=_default
  Note over U: "unprofiled source" volume<br/>is the trigger, not an outage

  E->>P: python -m veritas onboard sample.json
  P-->>E: coverage report:<br/>fields read vs fields NOT read
  E->>E: map each unread field, or<br/>record the decision to drop it
  E->>P: commit config/clinics/<new>.yaml
  Note over E,P: config change only —<br/>no code, no deploy, no migration

  P->>U: subsequent files use the new profile
  U-->>E: unmapped-test review queue
  E->>P: accept → promoted to learned_alias
  Note over P: each novel spelling is paid for<br/>once, then free forever (NFR-4.1)
